    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 4 and takes about 1 hour 35 minutes. The thing to watch is adding the peanut butter: stir it in gradually over medium heat rather than tipping it in all at once. Added too fast it can separate and never fully incorporate back into the sauce."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Brown the beef well before anything else goes in. This is a braise and the fond from the browned meat gives the sauce its depth. Pale, unstirred beef at the start means a flat, thin sauce at the end."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
